@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AA8B8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceParticipantPadding 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
hide footbox
autonumber
!include course-notation.iuml
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
title B 改进业务序列：推文闭环

actor "需求方" as D
participant "<$worker>\n采编部长" as E
participant "<$worker>\n运营部长" as M
participant "<$worker>\n排版干事" as W
participant "<$worker>\n一审老师" as T1
participant "<$worker>\n二审老师" as T2
participant "<$entity>\n推文协作档案" as S
D -> S : 登记需求与源稿
opt 外部来稿
E -> S : 阅读源稿并登记内容审核结论
end
M -> S : 登记承接安排
W -> S : 读取任务与材料
S --> W : 排版要求与源稿
W -> S : 提交排版版本
M -> S : 两位指定部长任一登记内审通过
T1 -> S : 阅读当前稿件并登记一审结论
T2 -> S : 一审通过后登记二审结论
M -> S : 登记公开发布地址
activate S
S -> S : 一并保留发布、归档与内部贡献
S --> M : 发布与归档回执
deactivate S
D -> S : 查询发布结果
activate S
S --> D : 可追溯的发布结果
deactivate S
legend bottom
业务工人：带斜线的人形圆标；业务实体：带斜线的圆标。
本图表达各岗位对业务档案的操作；自动保存由工作台实现。
退回后由承接人提交新版本，重新经过内审及教师两审。
教师一审、二审为不同人员；群机器人尚未接通。
endlegend

@enduml
